---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact availability, corrections, and ways to follow Psychology Blog.">
  <div class="container narrow section">
    <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Keep in touch</p><h1>A place for thoughtful feedback.</h1><p>Questions about an article, a broken link, or an idea for a future topic all matter.</p></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Contact details are coming</h2><p>The site owner's contact address has not yet been supplied. A working address and privacy contact will be added before public launch. There is currently no contact form or monitored inbox on this website.</p>
      <h2>Corrections and accessibility feedback</h2><p>Once contact is available, please include the page title, its link, and a short description of the issue. For accessibility feedback, it can help to describe the device or assistive technology you were using. Please leave out private health information.</p>
      <div class="callout"><h2>If you need personal support</h2><p>We cannot offer individual mental health advice or urgent support. If you need help now, visit <a href="/get-help/">Get Help</a> for local support options.</p></div>
      <h2>Follow new reading</h2><p>You can follow <a href="/rss.xml">our RSS feed</a> without giving us an email address, or check the <a href="/newsletter/">newsletter page</a> for signup availability.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Explore the articles <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
